Vocational Education and Training levy (1 % of the annual payroll of employers with a payroll of N$1 000 000 or more) (Vocational Education and Training Act 1 of 2008 s. 35 (1), (4), 41; Imposition of Vocational Education and Training Levy on Employers, GN 67 of 2021 (GG 7498, 1 April 2021) paras 2, 3, 5 (LAC annotated text and the Gazette, R4/fetch/p14/na_vetlevy_regs_anno.txt, na_gg7498_vetlevy2021.pdf) [text version: Act 1 of 2008 as annotated (LAC); GN 67 of 2021 as gazetted (GG 7498, 1 April 2021)]): Para. 3: 'An employer with an annual payroll of N$1 000 000 or more must pay the levy.' Para. 5: 'The rate of the levy is 1% of the amount of the annual payroll of the employer concerned.' 'payroll' = total annual remuneration (Income Tax Act Schedule 2 Part I). Applied as worded: the whole payroll at 1 % from N$1 000 000 inclusive; below it nothing. Fourteenth pass (FT reviewer 4 gap; the app's levy on smaller payrolls is NA FTS-1).

